WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.719 --> 00:00:02.850
Keanu Reeves in the Marvel Cinematic Universe?

00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:06.589
It could happen, and some people are refusing
to give up the ghost.

00:00:06.589 --> 00:00:11.130
Keanu Reeves is easily one of the most recognizable
action movie stars alive today, and for good

00:00:11.130 --> 00:00:12.130
reason.

00:00:12.130 --> 00:00:15.830
The "John Wick" movies have enjoyed monumental
success for being ultra-violent, ultra-entertaining

00:00:15.830 --> 00:00:16.960
thriller films.

00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:21.769
Overall, all three films have grossed $573
million worldwide and a fourth film is on

00:00:21.769 --> 00:00:27.730
the way.

00:00:27.730 --> 00:00:31.210
More recently, Reeves starred in the long-awaited
fourth entry in "The Matrix" franchise, "The

00:00:31.210 --> 00:00:32.850
Matrix Resurrections."

00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:35.940
Through all this, fans have been wondering
when Reeves would become involved in the Marvel

00:00:35.940 --> 00:00:36.940
Cinematic Universe.

00:00:36.940 --> 00:00:40.130
After all, it wouldn't be his first time stepping
into a comic book property.

00:00:40.130 --> 00:00:44.710
He could previously be seen in the titular
role in 2005's "Constantine," based on the

00:00:44.710 --> 00:00:46.390
DC Comics property.

00:00:46.390 --> 00:00:50.170
Reeves has confirmed that he's met with Marvel
Studios president Kevin Feige, but so far,

00:00:50.170 --> 00:00:52.830
they've been unable to come up with a way
to bring the actor into the fold.

00:00:52.830 --> 00:00:55.490
Of course, where there's a will there's a
way.

00:00:55.490 --> 00:00:59.420
Naturally, viewers have bided their time by
fan-casting him in many roles, and one of

00:00:59.420 --> 00:01:02.650
the more popular dream-casts for Reeves is
that of Ghost Rider.

00:01:02.650 --> 00:01:06.710
Luckily for those fans, some crafty digital
artists have imagined what Reeves could potentially

00:01:06.710 --> 00:01:08.330
look like in the role.

00:01:08.330 --> 00:01:12.950
Late last year, artist @MizuriAU posted some
fanart of Keanu Reeves with half of his face

00:01:12.950 --> 00:01:16.280
engulfed in flame and showcasing the trademark
Ghost Rider skull.

00:01:16.280 --> 00:01:20.000
From the leather jacket, it seems clear that
this particular piece of art is meant to portray

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:23.030
Reeves as the Johnny Blaze incarnation of
the character.

00:01:23.030 --> 00:01:26.670
Based on the art alone, the casting of Reeves
seems almost like a no-brainer for a "Ghost

00:01:26.670 --> 00:01:32.960
Rider" do-over, especially following the poor
reception of the Nicolas Cage "Ghost Rider"

00:01:32.960 --> 00:01:34.409
films.

00:01:34.409 --> 00:01:39.060
Still, there's no guarantee that Reeves will
ever step into that role, especially given

00:01:39.060 --> 00:01:42.600
his busy schedule with the "John Wick" movies
and whatever else he has in the pipeline.

00:01:42.600 --> 00:01:46.200
Furthermore, "The Walking Dead" star Norman
Reedus has shown a lot of interest in the

00:01:46.200 --> 00:01:49.590
role as of late, prompting rumors that the
part may already be his.

00:01:49.590 --> 00:01:52.480
Of course, Mizuri made a mockup of what that
might look like, too.

00:01:52.480 --> 00:01:56.190
Either way, it would be exciting for the MCU
to continue pushing in a darker direction

00:01:56.190 --> 00:01:57.190
with "Ghost Rider."

00:01:57.190 --> 00:02:01.189
If the upcoming release of the "Moon Knight"
series is any indication, Marvel seems more

00:02:01.189 --> 00:02:03.710
willing to take things closer to the edge.

00:02:03.710 --> 00:02:08.039
Alas, MCU fans hoping for concrete news regarding
the future of the Ghost Rider character will

00:02:08.039 --> 00:02:15.150
have to continue to be patient.

00:02:15.150 --> 00:02:18.900
Given his massive popularity, it should come
as no surprise that fans will take any excuse

00:02:18.900 --> 00:02:21.200
to have more Keanu Reeves in their lives.

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:24.470
Even if it doesn't work out with Ghost Rider,
there are thousands of characters across the

00:02:24.470 --> 00:02:28.670
pages of Marvel Comics, and surely, there's
a part out there for Reeves.

00:02:28.670 --> 00:02:32.780
He may be nearly 60, but he still has the
star power to put butts in the seats.

00:02:32.780 --> 00:02:35.900
As such, numerous artists have envisioned
what the actor could look like as a variety

00:02:35.900 --> 00:02:39.270
of characters who have still yet to appear
in the MCU.

00:02:39.270 --> 00:02:43.099
One Instagram artist that goes by the handle
@daanesh95, offered a glimpse of what he would

00:02:43.099 --> 00:02:44.420
look like as Namor the Sub-Mariner.

00:02:44.420 --> 00:02:48.690
There has been intense speculation that Namor
could make an appearance in "Black Panther

00:02:48.690 --> 00:02:50.930
2," but those have yet to be confirmed.

00:02:50.930 --> 00:02:54.680
It would undoubtedly be challenging to hide
Reeves' casting if that's the case, so perhaps

00:02:54.680 --> 00:02:57.910
it's possible Namor will make his debut in
a later MCU project.

00:02:57.910 --> 00:03:01.910
That same account also posted some artwork
of Reeves as a character we know he won't

00:03:01.910 --> 00:03:02.910
appear as.

00:03:02.910 --> 00:03:06.270
Years ago, Daanesh offered a portrait of Reeves
as Adam Warlock.

00:03:06.270 --> 00:03:09.830
We now know that that character will appear
in "Guardians of the Galaxy Vol. 3," as played

00:03:09.830 --> 00:03:11.290
by Will Poulter.

00:03:11.290 --> 00:03:14.180
Reeves certainly would've been an excellent
pick for that part, but it wasn't meant to

00:03:14.180 --> 00:03:15.180
be.

00:03:15.180 --> 00:03:18.640
That's not even getting into all of the iconic
characters Reeves could theoretically play

00:03:18.640 --> 00:03:22.069
one day, like Silver Surfer, Wonder Man, or
Nova.

00:03:22.069 --> 00:03:26.080
An actor of his talents could portray virtually
anyone, and fans would be utterly delighted.

00:03:26.080 --> 00:03:30.910
Then again, Reeves is a busy man these days,
so perhaps a multi-picture contract with Marvel

00:03:30.910 --> 00:03:32.970
would be too difficult to pull off.

00:03:32.970 --> 00:03:35.760
Still, there's nothing wrong with a little
hope.

